# Build artifacts and test output -- generated, never committed.
#
# Keeping bin/ and obj/ out of git is what stops a `dotnet build` during the coder
# leg from being swept into the commit by `git add -A`. That matters beyond tidiness:
# every tracked build artifact WIDENS the #694 read-only-review digest surface, so a
# late build-output write can trip the mutation guard and false-park honest work.
# The scan/gate runs on STAGED changes, so un-staged artifacts are never seen.
bin/
obj/

# The dotnet-console skeleton's offline `dotnet run -- --test` harness writes its
# pass/fail detail here at runtime.
test-results.txt
